$comment
ERROR EXAMPLE: SCF convergence failure.
Fe(II) porphine model, quintet (mult=5). MAX_SCF_CYCLES = 10 is far
too few for an open-shell first-row TM with near-degenerate states.
Q-Chem error: "SCF failed to converge" / SCF_NOT_CONVERGED.
Fix: raise MAX_SCF_CYCLES to 200+, try SCF_GUESS = sad or read,
SCF_ALGORITHM = diis_gdm or rca_diis.
$end

$molecule
0 5
Fe    0.000000   0.000000   0.000000
N     2.020000   0.000000   0.000000
N     0.000000   2.020000   0.000000
N    -2.020000   0.000000   0.000000
N     0.000000  -2.020000   0.000000
C     2.870000   1.100000   0.000000
C     2.870000  -1.100000   0.000000
C    -2.870000   1.100000   0.000000
C    -2.870000  -1.100000   0.000000
C     1.100000   2.870000   0.000000
C    -1.100000   2.870000   0.000000
C     1.100000  -2.870000   0.000000
C    -1.100000  -2.870000   0.000000
C     4.200000   0.680000   0.000000
C     4.200000  -0.680000   0.000000
C    -4.200000   0.680000   0.000000
C    -4.200000  -0.680000   0.000000
C     0.680000   4.200000   0.000000
C    -0.680000   4.200000   0.000000
C     0.680000  -4.200000   0.000000
C    -0.680000  -4.200000   0.000000
H     5.080000   1.310000   0.000000
H     5.080000  -1.310000   0.000000
H    -5.080000   1.310000   0.000000
H    -5.080000  -1.310000   0.000000
H     1.310000   5.080000   0.000000
H    -1.310000   5.080000   0.000000
H     1.310000  -5.080000   0.000000
H    -1.310000  -5.080000   0.000000
$end

$rem
   JOBTYPE          opt
   METHOD           b3lyp
   BASIS            6-31G*
   UNRESTRICTED     true
   MAX_SCF_CYCLES   10
$end

@@@

$molecule
   READ
$end

